The engineering team led by CTO Dr. Evelyn Reed provides technical oversight and R&D support. Key engineering dependencies include design specifications for Project Borealis Wind Farm, integration with UrbanMesh IoT Platform, and technology transfer from the SmartCity Innovation Lab - Seoul. Engineering resources are allocated at 21% capacity, with critical path activities including system architecture design, prototype development, and validation testing.

